    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4625" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλοίτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλείτης</span>
			, <i>avenger,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				10
			</span></i>:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀλοῖτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, ἡ, of Athena, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				936
			</span></i>: but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλοῖτις, ἡ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεντιανή</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.3
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μανδραγόρα ἄρρεν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.75
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλοιτός</span></b> , ὁ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
				ʽἀλιτεῖν̓</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλείτης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				136
			</span></i>: fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλοιταί: κοιναί, ἁμαρτωλαί,
				ποιναί</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλοίτης</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
